## SVG Mechanism: 3-Tier Cache Read Flow

This React JSX component and companion CSS stylesheet render an animated 2D architecture diagram of a 3-tier cache read flow (`Client -> Edge CDN -> Origin API -> Database`) with an upper **Hit fast path** and a lower **Miss fill path**. Because no `design/tokens.css` or `tokens.css` file was present in the workspace, the stylesheet defines `design/tokens.css`-compatible `--color-*` custom properties for light and dark modes and maps every SVG surface, track, arrow marker, and signal to internal `--mech-*` aliases with zero external dependencies.

### Stages & Token Map

- **Stages & Branches**
  1. **Client** — Sends a read request to Edge CDN and receives the response from either the Hit fast path or the Miss fill path.
  2. **Edge CDN (Tier 1)** — Evaluates the cache lookup; on a hit, returns immediately along the **Hit fast path** (`Edge CDN -> Client`); on a miss, forwards the read to Origin API and populates the cache on return.
  3. **Origin API (Tier 2)** — Receives cache-miss reads from Edge CDN, queries Database, and returns fetched data back along the **Miss fill path**.
  4. **Database (Tier 3)** — Authoritative source of truth queried on cache miss; initiates the **Miss fill path** (`Database -> Origin API -> Edge CDN -> Client`).
- **CSS Custom Properties (Synced Across Light & Dark Modes)**
  - Canvas & grid: `--mech-canvas` (`--color-surface-default`), `--mech-grid-dot` (`--color-border-default`), `--mech-frame-border` (`--color-border-default`)
  - Nodes & pills: `--mech-node-top` (`--color-surface-raised`), `--mech-node-bottom` (`--color-surface-subtle`), `--mech-node-border` (`--color-border-strong`), `--mech-pill-bg` (`--color-surface-raised`)
  - Typography: `--mech-text` (`--color-text-default`), `--mech-muted` (`--color-text-muted`), `--mech-accent-contrast` (`--color-action-primary-text`)
  - Tracks, markers & signals: `--mech-track` (`--color-border-strong`), `--mech-accent` (`--color-action-primary-bg`, primary request flow), `--mech-ok` (`--color-success-text`, Hit fast path), `--mech-warn` (`--color-warning-text`, Miss fill path), `--mech-focus` (`--color-border-focus`)

